msgid "轨道名称、声部色彩与 M/S/R 核心监控置于时间轴左侧黄金视线区，避免视线与鼠标大跨度跳跃。\n同时支持演出矩阵与线性轨道一键镜像切换，兼顾棚内制作与舞台即兴。"
msgstr "Track names, part colors, and core M/S/R monitoring sit in the golden sightline at the left of the timeline, so eyes and mouse never jump across the screen.\nThe performance matrix and linear tracks also mirror-switch in one click, serving both studio production and stage improvisation."

msgid "② 内联全功能 DSP 设备机架 (Zero Popups)"
msgstr "② Inline Full-Feature DSP Device Rack (Zero Popups)"

msgid "原生波表合成器、8段动态均衡器与总线粘合压缩器直接内联于底部机架，所有参数一屏触达并具备毫秒级实时频谱。\n彻底告别传统工作站中弹窗重叠遮挡时间轴的痛点，双击亦可按需展开独立浮窗。"
msgstr "A native wavetable synth, an 8-band dynamic EQ, and a bus glue compressor live inline in the lower rack — every parameter one screen away, with millisecond real-time spectra.\nNo more overlapping popups hiding the timeline as in traditional workstations; double-click to pop a device out into its own window when needed."

msgid "③ 即时混合工作流与无感缓冲热切"
msgstr "③ Instant Hybrid Workflow & Seamless Buffer Hot-Swap"

msgid "现场 Clip 激发抽屉与中心线性时间轴无缝联动，支持片段即兴激发与平滑拖拽入轨。\n音频缓冲区大小热切换实时生效无需重新载入工程，为母带与创作提供专业级低时延与强确定性。"
msgstr "The live Clip launch drawer links seamlessly with the central linear timeline — improvise with clips and drag them smoothly onto tracks.\nAudio buffer sizes hot-swap in real time with no project reload, giving mastering and creation professional-grade low latency and strong determinism."

msgid "提示：您可以随时点击顶栏「默认 / 演出 / 编曲 / 混音」在 4 种专业工作流间秒级切换。"
msgstr "Tip: Click Default / Live / Arrange / Mix in the top bar at any time to switch between the four professional workflows instantly."

